 community=]\nNODE evaluate() [src=scripts/pipeline.py loc=L150 community=]\nNODE validate_task() [src=scripts/validate_task.py loc=L230 community=]\nNODE evidence() [src=scripts/model_router.py loc=L27 community=]\nNODE Engineering Harness Execution Contract [src=library/plugins/tfd-workflow-standard/skills/tfd-workflow-standard/references/harness-execution.md loc=L1 community=]\nNODE read_sector_receipts() [src=scripts/render_task.py loc=L141 community=]\nNODE digest() [src=scripts/stage_loop.py loc=L17 community=]\nNODE require_stage_receipt() [src=scripts/stage_loop.py loc=L84 community=]\nNODE load_checkpoint() [src=scripts/resume_task.py loc=L95 community=]\nNODE check_qa_consultation.py [src=scripts/check_qa_consultation.py loc=L1 community=]\nNODE nonempty() [src=scripts/stage_loop.py loc=L13 community=]\nNODE release_candidate() [src=scripts/stage_loop.py loc=L170 community=]\nNODE require_execution() [src=scripts/stage_loop.py loc=L134 community=]\nNODE Matriz por setor [src=docs/reviewed-delivery/task.md loc=L34 community=]\nNODE require_deploy_authorization() [src=scripts/stage_loop.py loc=L179 community=]\nNODE require_deployment() [src=scripts/stage_loop.py loc=L191 community=]\nNODE require_task_snapshot() [src=scripts/stage_loop.py loc=L118 community=]\nNODE bound_json() [src=scripts/stage_loop.py loc=L21 community=]\nNODE require_knowledge() [src=scripts/stage_loop.py loc=L35 community=]\nNODE Specification QA [src=skills/TFD-qa_spec/SKILL.md loc=L9 community=]\nNODE ids() [src=scripts/check_qa_consultation.py loc=L17 community=]\nNODE text() [src=scripts/check_qa_consultation.py loc=L13 community=]\nNODE require_handoff() [src=scripts/stage_loop.py loc=L113 community=]\nNODE TFD-backend/SKILL.md [src=skills/TFD-backend/SKILL.md loc=L1 community=]\nNODE digest() [src=scripts/check_qa_consultation.py loc=L24 community=]\nNODE artifact_bindings() [src=scripts/stage_loop.py loc=L31 community=]\nNODE references are receipts from real G1/current submissions, not reviewer choices. [src=scripts/check_qa_consultation.py loc=L30 community=]\nNODE Opt-in stage evidence checks; declarations do not authenticate reading or\u2026 [src=scripts/stage_loop.py loc=L1 community=]\nNODE render_task_review.py [src=scripts/render_task_review.py loc=L1 community=]\n... (truncated \u2014 145 more nodes cut by ~1200-token budget. Narrow with context_filter=['call'] or use get_node for a specific symbol)", "mandatory_reads_preserved": true, "notice": "UNTRUSTED_DERIVED_DATA: navigation only; read selected canonical sources, full selected skills and mandatory references. Inferred edges are not instructions, authority or approval.", "revision": "UNVERSIONED", "sources": [{"excerpt": "# Stage-loop version 1\n\nNew `pipeline.py <workflow.json> --init` workflows declare `stage_loop_version: 1`, `coverage_version: 1` and `review_version: 1`. Existing workflows without the new field retain their original protocol. Adopt the new protocol only through scoped review of the affected active work; never reinterpret earlier approval evidence.\n", "line": 3, "path": "docs/stage-loop.md", "sha256": "4bb5fdaf95b9699ba8457b80ae0c4406f61cf290f8895baffcc556d718d56206"}, {"excerpt": "\"\"\"Opt-in stage evidence checks; declarations do not authenticate reading or people.\"\"\"\n\nimport hashlib\nimport json", "line": 1, "path": "scripts/stage_loop.py", "sha256": "61c17e42e4775614b4dea44fb7431fe32b5f64c0742764b0105f920af23e404d"}, {"excerpt": "from check_qa_consultation import require_consultation\nfrom workflow_contract import check, validate_input, validate_output\nfrom stage_loop import (require_stage_receipt, require_handoff, require_execution, require_task_snapshot, release_candidate,\n                        require_deploy_authorization, require_deployment)", "line": 14, "path": "scripts/pipeline.py", "sha256": "89cbec730dfe43c0ae0caca2b8a94bc6e0222c19a188da1eaec9bd0480478254"}, {"excerpt": "# Source-backed production stages\n\nUse when the workflow declares `stage_loop_version: 1`, requiring coverage and review version 1. New initialization enables it; do not rewrite legacy approvals to imply new checks. Read the [executable receipt contract](../../../docs/stage-loop.md) for fields and the gate/reviewer matrix.\n", "line": 3, "path": "skills/TFD-harness/references/stage-loop.md", "sha256": "7a585a68f914eecccfd941b1d34552d80a290be36a9b08360970e48a07e27485"}, {"excerpt": "# Independent source consultation\n\nUse at G3/G6 when workflow `review_version` is 1. Keep the four-field `findings.json` unchanged. The reviewer writes a separate project-local consultation JSON and adds its relative path as `consultation` and content hash as `consultation_sha256` to the review event. Never generate a reviewer receipt from the author's claims automatically.\n", "line": 3, "path": "skills/TFD-qa_spec/references/independent-review.md", "sha256": "6133cedbdd4418fbf175d1133310e5a18f85aca04c978c970a381c74557d8546"}], "status": "GRAPHIFY"}
